{"id":"circonstance","lemma":"circonstance","pos":"noun","rank":1764,"glosses":["circumstance, situation"],"ipa":"/siʁ.kɔ̃s.tɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b7/Fr-circonstance.ogg/Fr-circonstance.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"circonstances"},"formAudio":{"circonstances":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-circonstances.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les circonstances était alors différentes.","en":"The circumstances were different then.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"then"},{"g":"different","l":"différent"}]},{"text":"Cela dépend des circonstances.","en":"It depends on the circumstances.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to depend","l":"dépendre"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Son comportement était de circonstance.","en":"Her behavior was appropriate to the occasion.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"behaviour/behavior"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Les circonstances ont changé.","en":"Things changed.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to exchange","l":"changer"}]},{"text":"Il s'est adapté aux circonstances.","en":"He adapted himself to circumstances.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to adapt","l":"adapter"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}